msgstr "How TOCus handles extension-local data, permissions, deletion, and ordinary website requests."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "If TOCus doesn't have access to a website, it can't pause that site. You can update these permissions in your browser's extension settings."
msgstr "If TOCus doesn't have access to a website, it can't pause that site. You can update these permissions in your browser's extension settings."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "If you feel like it, pick different days and times for each site."
msgstr "If you feel like it, pick different days and times for each site."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "If you pause while on a website, the address might be saved for a short time so you can go back to it."
msgstr "If you pause while on a website, the address might be saved for a short time so you can go back to it."

