#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "The extension uses Chrome's browser features on your device to show pauses on the sites you choose. Its use of this information follows the"
msgstr "The extension uses Chrome's browser features on your device to show pauses on the sites you choose. Its use of this information follows the"

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "The source code is available on GitHub if you want to check for yourself."
msgstr "The source code is available on GitHub if you want to check for yourself."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "The statistics only keep track of counts and durations. They don't save any page content or web addresses."
msgstr "The statistics only keep track of counts and durations. They don't save any page content or web addresses."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "The TOCus extension has no analytics or tracking. Website analytics can't read your extension's site list, settings, or statistics."
msgstr "The TOCus extension has no analytics or tracking. Website analytics can't read your extension's site list, settings, or statistics."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "This includes your website list, pause times, schedules, preferences, and statistics."
msgstr "This includes your website list, pause times, schedules, preferences, and statistics."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "This site"
msgstr "This site"

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "This website and external links"
msgstr "This website and external links"

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "This website uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors use its pages. Google Analytics uses cookies and sends Google information such as pages visited, interactions, approximate location, and browser and device details. The developer can view reports about visits to this website."
msgstr "This website uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors use its pages. Google Analytics uses cookies and sends Google information such as pages visited, interactions, approximate location, and browser and device details. The developer can view reports about visits to this website."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "TOCus adds a breathing pause to the websites you choose."
msgstr "TOCus adds a breathing pause to the websites you choose."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "TOCus is an open-source browser extension."
msgstr "TOCus is an open-source browser extension."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "TOCus needs access to the websites you choose so it can show the pause. You control which sites to allow."
msgstr "TOCus needs access to the websites you choose so it can show the pause. You control which sites to allow."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "TOCus saves your choices using local storage. It uses scripts and browser rules to show the pause, and alarms to keep the timing correct."
msgstr "TOCus saves your choices using local storage. It uses scripts and browser rules to show the pause, and alarms to keep the timing correct."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "TOCus works entirely offline and doesn't track your data on your device."
msgstr "TOCus works entirely offline and doesn't track your data on your device."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "Use it only when you want to"
msgstr "Use it only when you want to"

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "Videos pause while you wait and resume when you’re ready."
msgstr "Videos pause while you wait and resume when you’re ready."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "View the source"
msgstr "View the source"

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "View your completed pauses and visits you changed your mind about."
msgstr "View your completed pauses and visits you changed your mind about."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "Website language"
msgstr "Website language"

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "What stays on your device"
msgstr "What stays on your device"

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "When you click the toolbar icon, TOCus gets access to the website you're currently visiting, but only for a short time, and doesn't send that data anywhere."
msgstr "When you click the toolbar icon, TOCus gets access to the website you're currently visiting, but only for a short time, and doesn't send that data anywhere."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "When you visit this website, your browser sends messages to the server that runs it. These messages can include your IP address, browser type, the page you want, and the time of the request. The hosting service may keep a record of these messages in server logs."
msgstr "When you visit this website, your browser sends messages to the server that runs it. These messages can include your IP address, browser type, the page you want, and the time of the request. The hosting service may keep a record of these messages in server logs."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "Why TOCus needs browser access"
msgstr "Why TOCus needs browser access"

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "Works with"
msgstr "Works with"

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "You can read the code, suggest changes, or make it your own. There’s no advertising."
msgstr "You can read the code, suggest changes, or make it your own. There’s no advertising."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "You don't have to just take my word for it."
msgstr "You don't have to just take my word for it."

#: apps/website/src/localization/privacy/index.ts
msgid "Your browser tries to use website icons from its own cache whenever it can. Sometimes this doesn't work. I set it up this way to keep TOCus completely private and avoid connecting to any icon service."
msgstr "Your browser tries to use website icons from its own cache whenever it can. Sometimes this doesn't work. I set it up this way to keep TOCus completely private and avoid connecting to any icon service."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "Your settings and stats stay in your browser. It even works offline and needs no account."
msgstr "Your settings and stats stay in your browser. It even works offline and needs no account."

#: apps/website/src/localization/index.ts
msgid "Your videos will pause automatically"
msgstr "Your videos will pause automatically"

